# Competency question: "Does every declined external bridge name a positive coverage
# witness that actually resolves to an in-slice term?" A gmeow:DeclinedCorrespondence
# is only safe if the external vocabulary's distinctions are carried, modeled up,
# in-slice — recorded as gmeow:contentCarriedBy. This ASK is true iff NO decline points
# at a dangling witness (an IRI that is the subject of no triple in the merged graph),
# so the positive-coverage claim cannot rot into a broken reference.

PREFIX gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/>

ASK {
    FILTER NOT EXISTS {
        ?decline a gmeow:DeclinedCorrespondence ;
            gmeow:contentCarriedBy ?witness .
        FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?witness ?p ?o }
    }
}
